            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.60

- Detects asynchronous questions outside Plan mode and shows the waiting-for-input indicator until you reply or the task resumes.
- Returns to the running indicator when Codex continues automatically, instead of leaving the task marked as waiting.
- Prevents recent activity records from overriding a current input or approval request. Applies to local and remote task status tracking.
]]></description>
